<header>
<h1 class="p-name">HOW TO DOWNLOAD BATTLEGROUNDS MOBILE INDIA IN JUST 5 STEPS</h1>
</header>
<section data-field="subtitle" class="p-summary">
When PUBG Mobile was banned in India, many users migrated to alternative options like COD mobile and free fire. While those are incredible…
</section>
<section data-field="body" class="e-content">
<section name="491e" class="section section--body section--first"><div class="section-divider"><hr class="section-divider"></div><div class="section-content"><div class="section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn"><h3 name="15e1" id="15e1" class="graf graf--h3 graf--leading graf--title">HOW TO DOWNLOAD BATTLEGROUNDS MOBILE INDIA IN JUST 5 STEPS</h3><figure name="945b" id="945b" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--h3"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="1*ZBFKbMfgqT3xIvBYBgKHiA.jpeg" data-width="320" data-height="144" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/1*ZBFKbMfgqT3xIvBYBgKHiA.jpeg"><figcaption class="imageCaption">BGMI</figcaption></figure><p name="dd93" id="dd93" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure">When PUBG Mobile was banned in India, many users migrated to alternative options like COD mobile and free fire. While those are incredible games, people still miss the gameplay of PUBG. BattleGrounds Mobile India, a version of PUBG specifically for India is finally launched.</p><p name="f30e" id="f30e" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">As of now, it is available in the Play Store only for pre-registered users. You also get some exclusive outfits and skins as perks for pre-registering the game. The game was said to be launched on June 18. But as a surprise, Krafton started rolling it out from June 17 onwards.</p><p name="4071" id="4071" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">As of now, the beta testing program is full and even many of the pre-registered users haven’t yet got the game. So plenty of websites started posting malicious links and claim that those are the files for the game.</p><p name="ca5e" id="ca5e" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">These files may contain security threats. App stores like Tap Tap also now have the game but nowadays there are so many fake apps on the internet that are so-called Tap Tap. Users find it difficult to download the game and install a legit version of the game. By following five easy steps, you can install BattleGrounds Mobile India on your mobile.</p><p name="7773" id="7773" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p"><strong class="markup--strong markup--p-strong">Step 1: Download the required files</strong></p><figure name="eade" id="eade" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--p"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="0*n5gt1YzQmJtR5C8t.jpg" data-width="254" data-height="320" data-is-featured="true" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/0*n5gt1YzQmJtR5C8t.jpg"></figure><p name="dbd7" id="dbd7" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure"><a href="https://www.jiocloud.com/s/?t=eurTDGvztrUWFRHc&amp;s=a4" data-href="https://www.jiocloud.com/s/?t=eurTDGvztrUWFRHc&amp;s=a4" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Click here</a> and you will be redirected to a drive. Download the zip file from the drive.</p><p name="ab6e" id="ab6e" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p"><strong class="markup--strong markup--p-strong">Step 2: Extracting the resources</strong></p><figure name="1563" id="1563" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--p"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="0*BSs0JPJbujMRMUvy.jpg" data-width="159" data-height="320" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/0*BSs0JPJbujMRMUvy.jpg"></figure><p name="38b7" id="38b7" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure">After downloading the zip file, you need to extract the resources from the file. You can use your phone’s native extractor or third-party apps like Z Archiver. Once you have successfully extracted the files, a folder named “Battlegrounds mobile India” will be automatically created on your device.</p><figure name="751a" id="751a" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--p"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="0*lTejof6qVEXdn6Cs.jpg" data-width="182" data-height="320" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/0*lTejof6qVEXdn6Cs.jpg"></figure><p name="3b9a" id="3b9a" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure">The folder will contain the APK file and a folder named “com.pubg.imobile”, which contains the data file.</p><p name="4fb8" id="4fb8" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Install the APK file but do not open it.</p><p name="116b" id="116b" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p"><strong class="markup--strong markup--p-strong">Step 4: Placing the resources in its correct path</strong></p><p name="5581" id="5581" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Copy the folder “com.pubg.imobile” to your phone’s Internal storage &gt; Android &gt; Obb and paste it there.</p><p name="ec3f" id="ec3f" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Open BattleGrounds Mobile in the settings and allow storage and mic access and it’s done.</p><p name="b602" id="b602" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Now you can open the game and it will run smoothly. If you encountered any other errors like “resources not found” while opening the app, check whether you have placed the Obb file in its correct path. If you still get errors, uninstall APK and repeat steps 3,4 &amp; 5. <a href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/2020/07/how-to-fix-resources-not-found-error_21.html" data-href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/2020/07/how-to-fix-resources-not-found-error_21.html" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Click here</a> to check out our previous blog for a detailed explanation on how to install these large files.</p><p name="7f80" id="7f80" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">In the loading screen, it shows Krafton instead of Tencent. Then you will be asked to download the resource packs required for the game. There are two options,</p><p name="d83c" id="d83c" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">I would suggest downloading the HD resource pack for a much better visual experience. If you have already played PUBG, and have a Google play games or a Facebook account already linked to PUBG, you can use the same account and all your old outfits, skins, and emotes will be back.</p><p name="e83b" id="e83b" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">The gameplay is as same as PUBG Mobile except for a few minor changes. Whenever you kill an opponent, It displays as finished instead of showing killed and the blood is now green in colour.</p><p name="de2f" id="de2f" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">You also get a pop-up message stating that BGMI is a virtual world and do not try these stunts at home kind of message. All other things are as same as PUBG Mobile. Now, you can only play on the India server.</p><p name="268f" id="268f" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">BattleGrounds Mobile India is a great game and while playing with a group of friends can be fun. But it is important to remember that, it is a game and we shouldn’t get too addicted to it. Playing it for a prolonged period affects both our physical and mental health.</p><p name="6504" id="6504" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p graf--trailing">Share this with your friends and comment if you have any doubts. Thank you for reading. Catch you up on the next blog. Bye.</p></div></div></section><section name="6139" class="section section--body section--last"><div class="section-divider"><hr class="section-divider"></div><div class="section-content"><div class="section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn"><p name="f444" id="f444" class="graf graf--p graf--leading graf--trailing"><em class="markup--em markup--p-em">Originally published at </em><a href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/2021/06/how-to-download-battlegrounds-mobile.html" data-href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/2021/06/how-to-download-battlegrounds-mobile.html" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><em class="markup--em markup--p-em">https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com</em></a><em class="markup--em markup--p-em"> on June 19, 2021.</em></p></div></div></section>
</section>
<footer><p>By <a href="https://medium.com/@gokulrece23" class="p-author h-card">Gokul Rajan</a> on <a href="https://medium.com/p/4947312eb01f"><time class="dt-published" datetime="2021-06-19T11:53:31.719Z">June 19, 2021</time></a>.</p><p><a href="https://medium.com/@gokulrece23/how-to-download-battlegrounds-mobile-india-in-just-5-steps-the-technobyte-4947312eb01f" class="p-canonical">Canonical link</a></p><p>Exported from <a href="https://medium.com">Medium</a> on April 28, 2026.</p></footer></article></body></html>